{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "おはようございます\nこんにちは\nこんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 菅原咲月（すがわらさつき）です🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobxtcSem.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "41stシングル\n「最後に階段を駆け上がったのはいつだ？」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "4月8日にリリースさせて頂きます！\nありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一つ一つのシングルがとても大切です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんと過ごせる時間\n同じ空気を共有できているという幸せ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもありがとうございます\nそして、どんな時でも乃木坂46を愛してくれてありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日、発表がありました\n41stシングルは選抜メンバーとして活動します！\nよろしくお願いします。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポジションは3列目の真ん中です！\nメンバーのことを1番よく見られるポジション。\nこの場所でしか見られない景色がきっと、あると思います\n無駄にせず、一つ一つ見落とさないようにしたい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分の行動や言葉を、自分で正解にしていきたい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今の私を見逃さないでください。\nついてきてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、41stシングル\nよろしくお願いします！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobSiCEd3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "てれの背中を1番見られる場所\n何かあったらそばで支えられる人でいたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも、お姉さんしてくれるてれさ😊\n沢山甘えさせてくれてありがとう🪽"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "笑顔でいっぱいの期間になりますように\n私も頑張る！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！\n明日からついにLIVEが開幕です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・乃⽊坂46 Coupling Collection 2022-2025"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・乃⽊坂46 5th ALBUM MEMORIAL LIVE 『My respect』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どちらも楽しみに待っていてね💘\n配信もございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場でも、お家でも🏠\n一緒に4日間楽しもう〜！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先日の乃木フェスイベントもありがとうございました🫶🏻🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobheV4I0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobRhJvHu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では！\n4日間素敵な思い出作りましょう！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私のサイリウムは🩷🩵です^ ^\n沢山振ってくれると嬉しいなぁ〜〜🥺"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2026.2.19"}], "source": "official"}